    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d374">

                <pb facs="0451" n="339" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg339"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.61351/47a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Food Administrator</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hoover</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-09-05">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 5, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: You are informed that the Cuban Minister
                    called at this Department and stated that his Government was informed that it
                    was the purpose of the United States Food Administration to fix a price for
                    sugar, and that his Government had instructed him to request that no definite
                    action be taken in this respect until after the Cuban Government had been given
                    an opportunity to acquaint <pb facs="0452" n="340" xml:id="pg340"/> the Food
                    Administration of its views on this subject. The Cuban Minister added that he
                    was prepared at any time to discuss this matter with you.</p>
                <p>The Cuban Minister was informed that his Government’s request would be
                    communicated at once to you.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Second Assistant Secretary</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
